<Layout faq={faq} title="Financial Planning for Athletes and Families | RIPL Wealth" description="Financial planning for high school, college and professional athletes: spending, tax coordination, investments, career transitions and financial boundaries.">
<section class="hero athlete-hero"><div class="wrap athlete-hero-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">HIGH SCHOOL, COLLEGE &amp; PROFESSIONAL ATHLETES</div><h1>Your sport gives you control over your income.<br><span class="athlete-gold">Your investment business gives you control over your future.</span></h1><p class="lead">Your earning opportunity can arrive early, and your playing career will not last forever. While the income is coming in, we help you build investments around life beyond the next contract.</p><p>We call that your investment business. Make room for life today while building toward a future where work can become optional.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn athlete-primary" href="/contact/">Talk to the Team</a><a class="text-link athlete-link" href="#athlete-support">See How We Help ↓</a></div><p class="small">Your money. Your decisions. A team in your corner.</p><div class="page-actions"><a class="text-link" href="/assessment/?track=athlete">Discover Your Wealth Persona →</a></div></div><aside class="athlete-priorities" aria-label="Questions we can help you answer"><div class="eyebrow">LET’S GET THE IMPORTANT THINGS CLEAR.</div><ul><li>What can I actually spend?</li><li>What do I need to set aside?</li><li>How do I make this money last?</li><li>Who can help me sort through the requests?</li></ul><p>You don’t have to have it figured out before we talk.</p></aside></div></section>

<section class="section athlete-intro"><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="eyebrow">MORE SUPPORT. LESS MENTAL CLUTTER.</div><h2>You can be great at your sport<br><span class="athlete-gold">and still be new to this.</span></h2></div><div><p class="lead">There’s a difference between earning money and having a system for it.</p><p>New income can bring decisions you’ve never had to make before. A bigger balance. More paperwork. People with ideas for your money. People who need your help. You deserve somewhere to bring those questions without a lecture.</p><p>We’ll explain your options in plain language, help you build a plan and stay involved as things change. You keep the final say. We help make sure you understand what you’re saying yes to.</p></div></div></section>


<section class="section dark"><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="eyebrow">FOR ATHLETES AND PARENTS</div><h2>Still in high school or college?<br><span class="athlete-gold">We work with you and your parents together.</span></h2></div><div><p class="lead">Wealth is being created younger than ever.</p><p>A first NIL deal can come before a first job. We sit down with the athlete and the family, so everyone understands the plan and the athlete learns to run it.</p></div></div></section>


<section class="section questions" id="athlete-support"><div class="wrap"><div class="athlete-section-head"><div class="eyebrow">YOUR WHOLE FINANCIAL LIFE</div><h2>More than an investment account.<br><span class="athlete-gold">A partner for the decisions around it.</span></h2><p class="lead">Athlete financial planning connects your income, spending, tax obligations, investments and future goals. We help put those decisions in one place, alongside the people you already trust.</p></div><div class="athlete-service-grid"><article><span class="athlete-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span><h3>Know what’s yours to spend.</h3><p>A payment hits your account. How much is actually available after taxes, fees and commitments? We help organize your cash flow, set aside reserves and build a spending plan that makes room for your life today.</p></article><article><span class="athlete-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span><h3>Get ahead of taxes.</h3><p>NIL deals, salary, endorsements and business income can bring different tax responsibilities. We coordinate with your tax strategist on income records, tax reserves, estimated payments and relevant state filing questions so taxes belong in the plan throughout the year.</p></article><article><span class="athlete-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span><h3>Build wealth beyond the next payment.</h3><p>Money for next month needs a different job than money for ten years from now. We help connect accessible cash, longer-term investments and your goals, with clear explanations of risk, costs and why each decision fits.</p></article><article><span class="athlete-number" aria-hidden="true">04</span><h3>Put opportunities through a real review.</h3><p>A brand deal. A friend’s business. A property. An equity offer. We help evaluate the financial commitment, cash needs, concentration and downside, and coordinate with your attorney and agent before you make a decision.</p></article><article><span class="athlete-number" aria-hidden="true">05</span><h3>Plan for changes in your career.</h3><p>A transfer, a new contract, an injury or a move can change the financial picture. We help review reserves, debt, insurance needs and ongoing expenses so the plan accounts for more than one version of what happens next.</p></article><article><span class="athlete-number" aria-hidden="true">06</span><h3>Help people without losing your footing.</h3><p>Supporting family or giving back can be part of your plan. We help you decide what you want to give, what you can sustain and how to handle requests. If you want us to communicate the boundaries, we can take that conversation off your plate.</p></article></div><p class="small athlete-scope">Tax filing, legal advice and contract representation stay with the appropriate professionals. We help coordinate the financial picture with them.</p></div></section>


<section class="section dark athlete-boundaries"><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="eyebrow">YOU CAN BE GENEROUS AND HAVE BOUNDARIES.</div><h2>Someone<br><span class="athlete-gold">in your corner.</span></h2><p class="lead">You shouldn’t have to turn every hangout or family conversation into a decision about money.</p></div><div><p>You may want to help the people who helped you get here. That matters. So does keeping your own financial life on track.</p><p>We can help you create a clear plan for gifts, family support and requests for loans. Then, if you want, send the requests to us. With your permission, we’ll help handle the conversation and explain when a request falls outside the boundaries you’ve chosen.</p><div class="athlete-script"><div class="eyebrow">A LINE YOU CAN USE</div><p>“I run financial requests through RIPL. Let me connect you with them.”</p></div><p>We can be the person who says, “That’s outside the giving plan we’ve agreed on.” You decide the boundaries and what can be shared. Your financial details stay out of that conversation.</p><a class="btn athlete-primary" href="/contact/">Talk to the Team</a></div></div></section>

<section class="section"><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="eyebrow">ENJOY TODAY. BUILD YOUR OPTIONS.</div><h2>Your next chapter<br><span class="athlete-gold">should belong to you.</span></h2></div><div><p class="lead">A good financial plan makes room for the life you want to live now and the choices you want later.</p><p>Maybe that’s a place of your own. Helping your parents. Starting a business. Continuing your education. Or having enough flexibility to choose what comes after your playing career.</p><p>We start there. Then we work backward: what needs to stay available, what can be invested for longer and what commitments make sense. The goal is to turn this opportunity into options you can use.</p><div class="athlete-paths"><article><h3>College &amp; NIL</h3><p>Organize new payments and expenses, coordinate taxes and keep your school’s compliance staff involved in eligibility and reporting questions.</p></article><article><h3>Professional sports</h3><p>Connect salary, bonuses, endorsements and recurring commitments with a plan for variable income and life beyond the current contract.</p></article></div></div></div></section>

<section class="section athlete-process"><div class="wrap"><div class="athlete-section-head"><div class="eyebrow">START SIMPLE</div><h2>You don’t need another complicated project.</h2><p class="lead">We help make the next steps clear.</p></div><ol class="athlete-steps"><li><h3>Tell us what’s happening.</h3><p>What’s coming in? What feels confusing? What decision is in front of you? Start with the short version.</p></li><li><h3>Get the picture organized.</h3><p>We identify the accounts, commitments, deadlines and professionals involved. Together, we decide what deserves attention first.</p></li><li><h3>Build a plan you understand.</h3><p>Clear priorities for spending, taxes, saving and investing. Agreed boundaries. A process for reviewing new decisions as your life changes.</p></li></ol><p>Before you decide to work with us, we’ll explain the scope, fees and who is responsible for what. You should understand the relationship as clearly as the plan.</p></div></section>


<section class="section"><div class="wrap athlete-faq"><div class="eyebrow">ATHLETE MONEY QUESTIONS</div><h2>The questions are welcome.</h2><article><h3>What does a financial advisor do for college and professional athletes?</h3><p>A financial advisor can help an athlete connect spending, cash reserves, taxes, investments and future goals into one plan. At RIPL, that also includes evaluating business decisions and setting boundaries around financial requests. We coordinate with your tax strategist, attorney and agent so you can understand the tradeoffs and make informed decisions.</p></article><article><h3>Is NIL income taxable?</h3><p>NIL income is generally taxable, including certain products or services received as compensation. Whether taxes are withheld and whether self-employment or estimated tax payments apply depends on how you are paid and the work involved. Keep records of payments, benefits and expenses, and review them with your tax professional.</p></article><article><h3>How much of my NIL or endorsement income should I set aside for taxes?</h3><p>There is no single percentage that fits every athlete. The amount depends on total income, withholding, payment type, deductible expenses and applicable state taxes. We help coordinate a reserve and payment plan with your tax strategist and review it when your income changes.</p></article><article><h3>Can RIPL help me say no when friends or family ask for money?</h3><p>Yes. We can help you establish a giving or lending policy and, with your permission, communicate the boundaries you choose. You decide who is involved and what may be shared. We can explain that a request falls outside your agreed plan without disclosing your account balances.</p></article><article><h3>Can I keep my agent, accountant and attorney?</h3><p>Yes. We work alongside the professionals you already trust. Your agent handles representation, your attorney handles legal advice and your tax strategist handles tax preparation and tax advice. RIPL helps connect the financial decisions, identify questions and coordinate the plan.</p></article><article><h3>Do I need a big professional contract before talking with RIPL?</h3><p>A professional contract is not the only reason to get organized. NIL income, endorsement payments or new financial responsibilities can also create decisions worth discussing. Start with your situation. We will explain the services, fees and whether there is a fit before you decide to work with us.</p></article></div></section>



<section class="assessment-band ripl-ripple" data-motion=""><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="eyebrow">A THREE-MINUTE START</div><h2>How do you think<br><span class="assessment-highlight">about money?</span></h2></div><div><p class="lead">Twelve statements and five quick picks. You get your wealth persona, its strengths, and what gets you to your next level.</p><a class="btn" href="/assessment/?track=athlete">Take the Athlete Quiz</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section dark athlete-closing"><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="eyebrow">MEET YOUR FINANCIAL TEAM</div><h2>Bring your questions.<br><span class="athlete-gold">We’ll start there.</span></h2><p class="lead">A new deal, a big decision or just the feeling that you need to get organized. You don’t need a polished presentation.</p><a class="btn athlete-primary" href="/contact/">Talk to the Team</a></div><div class="athlete-team-photo"><div class="ripl-photo-frame" data-motion><div class="photo-frame-image"><img src="/images/ripl-home-team.jpg" alt="The RIPL team in their Fort Collins office" loading="lazy"></div></div><a class="text-link athlete-link" href="/about/">Meet the Team →</a></div></div></section>


